"children":["Headache Headquarters"]}," from the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/April_Fools_2024_Event","title":"April Fools 2024 Event"},"children":["April Fools 2024 Event"]}," with minor changes. When it first started, only ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Headache_Headquarters","title":"Headache Headquarters"},"children":["Headache Headquarters"]}," was available. All other parts of the event were added a few hours later, the same day in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V1.59.0","title":"V1.59.0"},"children":["v1.59.0"]},". Multiple parts of the event were removed briefly in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V1.59.0","title":"V1.59.0"},"children":["v1.59.1"]}," but then re-added in ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V1.59.0","title":"V1.59.0"},"children":["v1.59.2"]},"."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The baseplate lobby was removed around 12 hours after it was added. At the same time, the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/April_fools_2025","title":"April fools 2025"},"children":["April fools 2025"]}," modifier was removed from all games, except ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Baseplate-L","title":"Baseplate-L"},"children":["Baseplate-L"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Baseplate-W","title":"Baseplate-W"},"children":["Baseplate-W"]},". Later, on the 8th of April 2025, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Headache_Headquarters","title":"Headache Headquarters"},"children":["Headache Headquarters"]}," would become unavailable. On the 9th of April 2025, ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Baseplate-L","title":"Baseplate-L"},"children":["Baseplate-L"]}," and ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Baseplate-W","title":"Baseplate-W"},"children":["Baseplate-W"]}," would be removed from ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Elevators","title":"Elevators"},"children":["Elevators"]}," and the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Index","title":"Index"},"children":["Index"]},". Currently, the only content from ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["April Fools 20